div id=\"tribe-events-content\" class=\"tribe-events-single\">\n\n\t<p class=\"tribe-events-back\">\n\t\t<a href=\"#/page?file=events-list%2Findex.html\"> « 전체 이벤트</a>\n\t</p>\n\n\t<!-- Notices -->\n\t\n\t<h1 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-title\">부부가 함께 하는 소그룹 인도자 훈련 | Leadership training for Married couple</h1>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-schedule tribe-clearfix\">\n\t\t<h2><span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">2020-08-22@10:00 오전</span>-<span class=\"tribe-event-date-end\">2020-09-12@12:30 오후</span></h2>\t</div>\n\n\t<!-- Event header -->\n\t<div id=\"tribe-events-header\" data-title=\"부부가 함께 하는 소그룹 인도자 훈련 - 러브 토론토 (Love Toronto)\" data-viewtitle=\"부부가 함께 하는 소그룹 인도자 훈련\">\n\t\t<!-- Navigation -->\n\t\t<nav class=\"tribe-events-nav-pagination\" aria-label=\"이벤트 네비게이션\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"tribe-events-sub-nav\">\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"tribe-events-nav-previous\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D3773.html\"><span>«</span> 이전</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"tribe-events-nav-next\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D3875.html\">다음 <span>»</span></a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t<!-- .tribe-events-sub-nav -->\n\t\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- #tribe-events-header -->\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-3844\" class=\"post-3844 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\">\n\t\t\t<!-- Event featured image, but exclude link -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-event-image\"><img width=\"720\" height=\"960\" src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/%EC%86%8C%EA%B7%B8%EB%A3%B9%EC%9D%B8%EB%8F%84%EC%9E%90%ED%9B%88%EB%A0%A8.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n\t\t\t<!-- Event content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>Love Family 에서는 오는 8월 22일(토)부터 9월12일까지 4주간 자원 봉사자들을 위한 ‘부부가 함께하는 소그룹 인도자 훈련’ 을 on line 실시간 프로그램으로 운영합니다.<br>\n다양한 소그룹 모임에서 좋은 촉진자 역할에 필요한 지식을 배우고, 실습을 통해 실질적인 역량이 높아지리라 기대합니다.<br>\n또한, 부부가 함께 참여하므로 부부가 더 가까워지는 좋은 경험을 하게 될 것입니다.<br>\n참여를 원하시는 분은 첨부파일의 내용을 참고하셔서 신청서를 접수하여 주시고, 주변에 필요한 분들에게 추천해 주시길 부탁드립니다.</p>\n<p><strong></strong></p><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><strong>\n<a data-e-disable-page-transition=\"true\" class=\"dlm-download-link dlm-download-default wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" title=\"\" href=\"./archive/download/3846/document.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" id=\"download-link-3846\" data-redirect=\"false\" type=\"application/pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n\t부부소그룹인도자훈련신청서\t(4880 downloads\t)\n</a>\n</strong></div><strong>\n</strong><p></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- .tribe-events-single-event-description -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events tribe-common\">\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-common-c-btn-border tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__button\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg class=\"tribe-common-c-svgicon tribe-common-c-svgicon--cal-export tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__export-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 23 17\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\t<path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M.128.896V16.13c0 .211.145.383.323.383h15.354c.179 0 .323-.172.323-.383V.896c0-.212-.144-.383-.323-.383H.451C.273.513.128.684.128.896Zm16 6.742h-.901V4.679H1.009v10.729h14.218v-3.336h.901V7.638ZM1.01 1.614h14.218v2.058H1.009V1.614Z\"></path>\n\t<path d=\"M20.5 9.846H8.312M18.524 6.953l2.89 2.909-2.855 2.855\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg>\n\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__button-text\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tribe-events-subscribe-dropdown-content\" aria-label=\"캘린더에 이벤트를 추가하기 위한 링크 보기\">\n\t\t\t\t\t캘린더에 추가하기\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t<svg class=\"tribe-common-c-svgicon tribe-common-c-svgicon--caret-down tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__button-icon\" aria-h